{\plain \fs28 Human Rights Watch World Report 2001}{\plain \par
}{\plain This report reviews human rights practices in seventy countries and describes events from November 
1999 through October 2000.\par
}{\plain Online version is available at: }{\field{\*\fldinst  HYPERLINK "http://www.hrw.org/wr2k1/" }{\fldrslt{{\*\cs10\ul\cf2 http://www.hrw.org/wr2k1/}}}}{\plain \par
